<Weakness_Catalog xmlns="http://cwe.mitre.org/cwe-8" xmlns:xhtml="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" Name="CWE" Version="5.0" Date="2026-10-28"><Weaknesses><Weakness ID="79" Name="Improper Neutralization of Input During Web Page Generation" Abstraction="Base" Structure="Simple" Status="Stable" Diagram="/data/images/CWE-79-Diagram.png">
         <Description>The product does not neutralize or incorrectly neutralizes user-controllable input before it is placed in output that is used as a web page that is served to other users.</Description>
